  "bio": "Dane Tattoo is a highly skilled professional tattoo artist based in Zurich, Switzerland, who has mastered traditional, geometric, and fineline styles, ensuring every design is unique and extraordinary. Known for his professionalism and cleanliness, he is currently offering his expertise at The Lovelorn Tattoo studio in Athens. To secure an appointment with him, just drop an email at daneoner2@gmail.com.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland\n\nBased in Athens owner of @the_lovelorn_tattoo\n24 - 27 February at @theburningeyetattoo \nZurich Switzerland 🇨🇭",
